OL,3,GNEWSAFormer boxer to host annual school
OL,4,Auniform giveaway
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree school uniforms are to be handed
OL,7,Fout in Hull by former boxer Tommy
OL,8,FCoyle.
OL,10,FThe ex-Commonwealth lightweight
OL,11,Fchampion set up a sporting foundation
OL,12,Fwhen he retired from boxing in 2019 and
OL,13,Fhas led a number of initiatives for
OL,14,Funderprivileged children, including a
OL,15,Fmobile boxing gym.
OL,17,F"If you're in a position to do good
OL,18,Fthen I believe you should," he said.
OL,20,FThe event at Coyle's gym, TC60, on
OL,21,FHumber Street will take place on
OL,22,FThursday from 10:00 until 13:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
